### listar professores
GET http://localhost:3333/professores

### cadastrat professor
POST http://localhost:3333/professores
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Emilly",
    "email": "emilly@email.com",
    "senha": "123456",
    "tipo": "comum"
}

### editar professor
PUT http://localhost:3333/professores/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "bianca"
}

### remover professor
DELETE http://localhost:3333/professores/1

### listar favotiros
GET http://localhost:3333/favoritos


### cadastrat favorito
POST http://localhost:3333/favoritos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_material": 6
}

### remover favoritos
DELETE http://localhost:3333/favoritos/1

### cadastrar material
POST http://localhost:3333/materiais
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="titulo"

Introdução a topografia

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descricao"

Material sobre Topografia

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="disciplinaId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="professorId"

2
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="aula1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./arquivos/aula1.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### listar materiais
GET http://localhost:3333/materiais

### atualizar materiais
PUT http://localhost:3333/materiais/6
Content-Type: application/json

{ 

    "titulo": "Mineralogia",
    "descricao": "pedras",
    "disciplinaId": 1

}

### deletar materiais
DELETE http://localhost:3333/materiais/6

### criar disciplinas
POST http://localhost:3333/disciplinas
Content-Type: application/json

{

    "nome" : "topografia"

}

### listar disciplinas
GET http://localhost:3333/disciplinas

### atualizar disciplinas
PUT http://localhost:3333/disciplinas/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ 

    "nome": "Topografia avançada"
}

### deletar disciplinas
DELETE http://localhost:3333/disciplinas/2